OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMost showers
OL,6,Fdying out but a few may continue to
OL,7,Faffect the North Coast. Otherwise, dry
OL,8,Fwith clear spells and becoming rather
OL,9,Fchilly with patchy fog developing
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FEarly fog patches quickly
OL,13,Fclearing to leave a largely dry day
OL,14,Fwith sunny spells. A chance of the odd
OL,15,Fshower near the North Coast at first.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,18,Fwith long sunny spells on Monday and
OL,19,Fbecoming a little warmer. Outbreaks of
OL,20,Frain spread north on Tuesday and
OL,21,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
